WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.011
Describe age-appropriate accounts of the early lives and occupations of religious

00:00:05.011 --> 00:00:05.448
leaders.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:11.305
The curriculum discusses Jesus Christ, Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) and a

00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:15.939
traditional religious leader such as Egya Ahor. Its occupational examples are Jesus

00:00:15.939 --> 00:00:20.961
as a carpenter, Muhammad as a businessman and Egya Ahor as a farmer.

00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:26.039
Different communities may preserve accounts in different ways. Discuss each

00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:30.295
respectfully and check stories with reliable religious or community sources.

00:00:31.117 --> 00:00:36.451
Use approved texts or a knowledgeable elder to learn and retell one early-life

00:00:36.451 --> 00:00:38.093
account without inventing details.
